      "sourceTextSha256": "3442814eb4091f789b62a6817c9ec341801bc0c7306061bb2a4974fae4af1479",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival at Rio de Janeiro airport, where a driver awaits you with a sign bearing your names, for the transfer to your hotel. On the way you will see green hills, rocky mountains, palm trees and beautiful bays; at nightfall, the city is surrounded by a shimmering necklace of lights. The rest of the day is at leisure, to dive into the exuberant life of the city or to find a quiet corner between palm trees, sand and ocean waves.",
