    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "78390a685795bbfbc4c04eac329277962fc089a42e1a3a71a791cb9a4a94e937",
      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, a half-day excursion (4 hours) to Sugar Loaf. From Praia Vermelha (Red Beach), the cable car takes you to Urca Hill, with its wide viewing area, restaurant and bar, and on to Sugar Loaf, with a beautiful view of Rio, Copacabana Beach, the bay, the surrounding mountains and islands, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and the statue of Christ. Then drive to the old centre of Rio to admire its churches, monasteries, cathedral and colonial-style buildings.",
